  "summary": "An experienced developer with strong emphasis on designing applications that are portable, easy to support and built with testing in mind. I apply engineering practice to software and test design. In 2006 I was certified as a software test professional. This knowledge has helped me to work with customers to assess and clarify requirements. It has also helped me provide software, test cases, and metrics that insure that the customer's needs and expectations are met or exceeded.\n\nSpecialties: Over 12 years experience in embedded system software design. \nC, C++, Visual Basic, Java Script, VBScript and HTML\nJ1939 CAN communication.\nControl of electrohydraulic systems.\nTest design and test automation. \nAssessment of customer requirements.\nDale Carnegie Graduate with 2 class awards.\nCertified in 2006 as a software test professional by IIST.",
